  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NONBUDSUPPFINAID and P0080 for Palestinian Civil Policing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity NONBUDSUPPFINAID and P0080 for Palestinian Civil Policing is a component of Support to the professional development of the Palestinian Civil Police in the Occupied Palestinian Territories. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;1,026,820. It works in the following sector(s): Legal and judicial development, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
